<title>NETHERLANDS: Shares in ING slip after Q1 results.</title>
<headline>Shares in ING slip after Q1 results.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dutch banking and insurance group ING Groep NV slipped after it announced first quarter results and declined to give a firm forecast for 1997.</p>
<p>The results were in line with analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>The shares were about one guilder higher before the first quarter results were released but started to slip soon afterwards.</p>
<p>They were down 0.40 guilders at 87.80 guilders at 0930 GMT after touching a day's low of 87.50 guilders after the results.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
